  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### How to amend the rounding difference shown in accounts?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 31 Dec, 2021 at  3:38 PM\n\n\t\tPlease note that when all the entries saved in a Trial Balance are not rounded perfectly, the system needs to do an auto-rounding to tally the accounts. This generates a minor value which goes to a designated account. The user can choose the rounding accounts as shown below. \n\nNavigation: Accounts Production Dashboard >> General Settings >> Report Format >> Other Settings \n\nPlease note, accounts must be regenerated for the changes to reflect.  \n\nPlease refer below video and screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to use the rounding feature\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188543\">Accounts Production FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to amend the rounding difference shown in accounts?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 31 Dec, 2021 at  3:38 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Please note that when all the entries saved in a Trial Balance are not rounded perfectly, the system needs to do an auto-rounding to tally the accounts.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This generates a minor value which goes to a designated account. The user can choose the rounding accounts as shown below.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: Accounts Production Dashboard &gt;&gt; General Settings &gt;&gt; Report Format &gt;&gt; Other Settings&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Please note, accounts must be regenerated for the changes to reflect. &nbsp;<br><br>Please refer below video and screenshot for more help.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9148252756/original/89cnt71oM_g_vvPHPFDgoSw32JSPCYzx1w.gif?1640964617\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9148252756\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074126363/original/4WT_7-sT-wykX-8Q-bO7G5RFhmytTZRjvA.png?1553518472\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074126363/original/4WT_7-sT-wykX-8Q-bO7G5RFhmytTZRjvA.png?1553518472\" data-fileid=\"9074126363\" data-uniquekey=\"1553518462801\" style=\"width: 1030px;\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/589d5afe2e11491aaf338e9b4f6d3eea\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click here to watch how to use the rounding feature</strong></a></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=